  "answer": "**答案:5%。** 在股东批准的前提下,Anthropic 在 2026 年 10 月 18 日的公告中说,最初会把 5% 的股份投入 Anthropic Public Benefit Fund。公告还说,公司价值每比某个基准线高出 50%,董事会可酌情再追加 2%。\n\n我只看了搜索结果里的摘要,没有打开原文。\"5%\"和\"需股东批准\"这两点,在 Anthropic 官方公告页和多家媒体的标题或摘要里一致。\n\n依据网址:\n- [Anthropic 官方公告:Investing in the public benefit](https://www.anthropic.com/news/public-benefit-fund)\n- [Forbes:Anthropic Public Benefit Fund Explained](https://www.forbes.com/sites/siladityaray/2026/10/19/anthropic-pledges-5-of-its-shares-to-public-benefit-fund-heres-how-it-works/)\n- [Al Jazeera:Anthropic commits 5% of shares to 'public benefit' fund](https://www.aljazeera.com/economy/2026/10/19/anthropic-says-it-will-commit-5-of-shares-to-public-benefit-fund)\n- [AI Magazine:Anthropic To Invest 5% of Shares to Its Public Benefit Fund](https://aimagazine.com/news/anthropic-to-invest-5-of-shares-to-its-public-benefit-fund)",
